    <briefdescription>
<para>Standard Rapid EOP <ref refid="structostk_1_1physics_1_1coordinate_1_1frame_1_1provider_1_1iers_1_1_finals2000_a_1_1_data" kindref="compound">Data</ref> since 01. January 1992 (IAU2000) </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This file (updated weekly) is the complete Earth orientation data set, since 1 January 1992 with 1 year of predictions. The nutation series in dX and dY uses the IAU 2000A Nutation Theory.</para>
